rstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)", "score": 1.172, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPA-050 auto_related_family (repeated_by_later_family) FAM:SF-APPM-022", "FAM:SF-APPA-050 auto_related_family (repeat_of_earlier_family) FAM:SF-APPM-022"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)", "auto_outcome_status": "inconclusive", "observed_hypothesis": "Specific opposing lineups, defenders, play types and preceding opponent play types suppress star efficiency.", "observed_result": "Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.", "observed_sample_and_power": "SE per cell reported", "auto_validation_status": "no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED", "observed_verdict": "inconclusive", "observed_failure_type": "E_unclear", "observed_notes": "NOT_RECORDED", "auto_confidence": "medium (0.65)"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-050"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-011", "label": "Study family SF-APPM-011: Net-swing play-type scoring prototype", "score": 1.166, "reached_via": ["request matches the question or hypothesis of FAM:SF-APPM-011 (0.79)", "request matches DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups (0.75); FAM:SF-APPM-011 auto_uses_dataset DS:NBA_play_by_play_possessions_and_reconstructed_lineups"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Net-swing play-type scoring prototype", "auto_outcome_status": "not a hypothesis test", "observed_hypothesis": "Scoring PTs by own PPP minus opponent next-possession PPP changes recommendations.", "observed_result": "Top recommendation changes in 40/104 = 38% units; DRIVE